    "detailed_description": "Looking for a clicker-style incremental game with active, strategic skill-based gameplay instead of idling around doing nothing? You've come to the right place! Successfully complete bullet-hell minigames to open chests and earn currency to buy upgrades!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake tactical decisions and play well to get coins and loot to well... open more chests!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing a campaign with custom designed levels to challenge you and an endless mode to mess about in! Both modes earn you coins and diamonds you can use to upgrade your skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNO IN-APP PURCHASES! This is the complete game and you earn double the meta-currency on this version compared to the Android version :)  I hope you enjoy the game!",
